'''Basic Law: Human Dignity and Liberty''' ({{Lang-bl|Ley Fundamental: Dignidad Humana y Libertad}}) is a [[Basic Laws of Balisca|Basic Law]] in the [[Baliscan Confederation]], enacted to codify and protect [[Human rights in Balisca|the country's main human rights]]. It recognizes [[W:Autonomy|autonomy]] and the [[W:Right to resist|right to resist]], empowering the people to challenge legislation which contradicts it, as well as protection from [[W:State of emergency|Emergency Regulations]].  

